`,requiresFtp:!0},space_to_tab:{label:"Spaces to Tabs",help:`If this is set to true, all spaces in the column values will be replaced with 
tabs.
`,modes:[],advanced:!0},to_posix_lines:{label:"To POSIX Lines",help:`If this is set to true, convert windows-style line endings to POSIX ones.
`,modes:[],advanced:!0},auto_decompress:{label:"Auto Decompress",help:`This is a boolean value that indicates whether the dataset should be automatically decompressed if it is
